t has no ready-made Gymnasium evaluation contract; observation, action timing and reset/success detection need a harness.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Start with the free binary and a fixed level to establish a control baseline.","For code edits, follow the repository build instructions with CMake and the required C++ dependencies.","Pin the game version, level, settings and input timing before comparing agents.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Modify jump acceleration or a collision edge case, then replay a fixed level.","Measure completion rate, deaths, missed jumps and time for a screen-based controller.","Change a level and verify checkpoints, enemies and completion conditions.","AI 使用与评估条件","Code access supports instrumented experiments, but GPL code and CC BY-SA game data carry different obligations. Keep any redistributed screenshots, maps or data exports traceable to their source licenses.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Independent downloads","https://www.supertux.org/download.html","Steam release","https://store.steampowered.com/app/1572920/SuperTux/","Official game source and licensing","https://github.com/SuperTux/supertux","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":104},"许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Most game data uses CC BY-SA; individual files and third-party components have additional notices.","assetLicense","代码许可","GNU GPL; inspect the pinned version and component notices before distributing a modified build.","codeLicense","开始使用",[122],"access",{"_58":123,"_25":124,"_125":126},"Play official browser build","https://play.supertux.org/","note","Official browser play, a free Steam release and independent desktop downloads are available. Building modified core code requires the native toolchain.","主要来源",[130],"sourceUrl",{"_58":127,"_25":104},"技术栈","C++ / CMake / 2D platformer","stack",